# Safety package rules

When editing `internal/safety`:

- Wipe / unbounded delete / “everything in the cluster” stays **hard-denied** — do not soften into warn-and-continue.
- Named single-resource delete is the allowed delete shape; keep corpus coverage for adversarial prompts (`deny_corpus_test.go`, SEC-* cases).
- Deny UX: punchline flavor pack + stable **Next:** remediation line; do not remove that contract for “cleaner” errors.
- Safety gates PlanResult before apply — never bypass from executor or agent notify paths.
- Prefer extending regex/checkers + table tests over one-off string equals.
- Run `go test ./internal/safety/` after changes.
